{"name":"pagina_participantes_escala_culto_infantil","type":"code/html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="pt-BR">\n<head>\n<meta charset="UTF-8">\n<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n<title>Disponibilidade - Culto Infantil</title>\n<link href="[https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap\](https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap\)" rel="stylesheet">\n<style>\n*{\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;\n}\n\nbody{\n    background:#f8f6f2;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:center;\n    padding:40px 15px;\n    color:#444;\n}\n\n.container{\n    width:100%;\n    max-width:700px;\n    background:white;\n    border-radius:18px;\n    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08);\n    overflow:hidden;\n}\n\n.header{\n    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd54f,#ffb74d);\n    color:white;\n    text-align:center;\n    padding:35px;\n}\n\n.header h1{\n    font-size:30px;\n}\n\n.header p{\n    margin-top:10px;\n    font-size:17px;\n}\n\n.content{\n    padding:30px;\n}\n\nlabel{\n    display:block;\n    margin-bottom:8px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n}\n\ninput,select{\n    width:100%;\n    padding:12px;\n    border-radius:10px;\n    border:1px solid #ddd;\n    margin-bottom:25px;\n    font-size:16px;\n}\n\n.calendar{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);\n    gap:10px;\n}\n\n.day{\n    background:#fafafa;\n    border:2px solid #eee;\n    border-radius:12px;\n    padding:14px 0;\n    text-align:center;\n    cursor:pointer;\n    transition:.2s;\n    user-select:none;\n    font-weight:bold;\n}\n\n.day:hover{\n    background:#fff9e8;\n}\n\n.day.selected{\n    background:#81c784;\n    color:white;\n    border-color:#66bb6a;\n}\n\n.info{\n    margin:25px 0;\n    background:#fff8e1;\n    border-left:5px solid #ffca28;\n    padding:15px;\n    border-radius:10px;\n    line-height:1.6;\n}\n\nbutton{\n    width:100%;\n    padding:16px;\n    border:none;\n    border-radius:12px;\n    background:#4caf50;\n    color:white;\n    font-size:18px;\n    cursor:pointer;\n    transition:.2s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover{\n    background:#43a047;\n}\n\n.footer{\n    margin-top:25px;\n    text-align:center;\n    color:#888;\n    font-size:14px;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class="container">\n\n<div class="header">\n<h1>🌈 Escala do Culto Infantil</h1>\n<p>Informe sua disponibilidade para servir neste mês ❤️</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class="content">\n\n<label>Seu nome</label>\n<input type="text" placeholder="Ex.: Maria Oliveira">\n\n<label>Mês da escala</label>\n<select>\n<option>Agosto 2026</option>\n<option>Setembro 2026</option>\n<option>Outubro 2026</option>\n</select>\n\n<label>Selecione os dias em que você pode servir:</label>\n\n<div class="calendar" id="calendar"></div>\n\n<div class="info">\n🙏 Marque apenas os dias em que você realmente estará disponível para participar do Culto Infantil.\n</div>\n\n<button>Salvar Disponibilidade</button>\n\n<div class="footer">\nQue Deus abençoe seu ministério! 💛\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst calendar=document.getElementById('calendar');\n\nfor(let i=1;i<=31;i++){\n\nconst day=document.createElement('div');\nday.className='day';\nday.innerText=i;\n\n\nday.onclick=()=>{\n    day.classList.toggle('selected');\n}\n\ncalendar.appendChild(day);\n\n}\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>"}
  
